ia for telling me about this expo!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_23","text":"I even got to see the limited-edition BOOM package!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_24","text":"I'm so happy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_25","text":"Oh, right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_26","text":"Be sure to send me the photos you took, Mr. Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_27","text":"The ones of you in front of the BOOM package?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_28","text":"Yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_29","text":"I'll send them to you later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_30","text":"Thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_31","text":"I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_32","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_32","text":"For a little while, no messages came through.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_33","text":"Thanks for the experience, everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_boomsday_03_34","text":"Hehehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_boomsday_03_35","type":"Speech","spe